  "globalSystems": {
    "elementalSystem": "Basic triangle element system utilized in usePetBattleStore.ts. Fire > Nature > Water > Fire, and Earth > Air > Water. Strong type gets +25% modifier on attack, Weak gets -25%. Shadow modifies both dealt and received damage (+15%/-15%). Aether is immune to elemental triangles but acts similarly by universally increasing damage via raw stat scaling. Some overlap logic with Ethereal Cow.",
    "statusEffectSystem": "Ability-based buff/debuff modifiers natively supported via `usePetBattleStore.ts` AbilityType logic. Supported buffs: `buff_atk`, `debuff_def`, `reduce_damage`. Uses flat additive values and duration timers that tick down per turn loop.",
    "damageFormula": "Math.max(1, Math.floor((move.power * atkTotal / (defTotal + 5)) * typeMult))",
    "turnLogic": "Speed-based priority system. The pet with higher `attackSpeed * 10` acts first in the turn. Calculates moves side-by-side using `usePetBattleStore.ts` `useMove()` function, applying attacks, lowering cooldowns, and evaluating end-of-turn battle log outputs.",
    "scalingSystem": "Base stats at Level 1 are fixed via `PET_DATABASE`. Pet instance stats scale adaptively via `getPetBattleStatsScaled()`. Formula: +3 HP, +0.5 ATK per level over 1. 'Rare' flag yields +15% flat boost to all stats. Ascension logic exists granting +10% per star (0-5 stars) to base stats multiplier."
  }
}
